      <h2>I spent years building software for other business owners.</h2>
      <p>I started Upstack Studio in 2017. My team and I built web and mobile products for real businesses. I learned that the hard part is rarely the code. It is choosing the right problem and understanding the customer well enough.</p>
      <p>Eventually, I shut the agency down. I could have kept improving the model, but it was no longer the company I wanted to build.</p>
      <p>Today, I’m building Second Team and a portfolio of products I own. I share what I learn along the way.</p>
